NAME     TRI-X 400
RECIPE   Kodak Tri-X 400, mid contrast (X-Trans IV)
CREDIT   Anders Lindborg, published by Ritchie Roesch / Fuji X Weekly
SOURCE   https://fujixweekly.com/2020/06/18/fujifilm-x100v-film-simulation-recipe-kodak-tri-x-400
DESC     GRITTY BLACK AND WHITE, OPEN MIDS, BIG GRAIN
NOTE     The WB shift (R+9 B-9) acts as a warm contrast filter before the B&W conversion.
BASE     acros.fs
WB       DAYLIGHT
SHIFT    +9 -9
DR       200
HIGHLIGHT 0
SHADOW   +3
COLOR    0
CLARITY  +4
GRAIN    STRONG LARGE
CCE      STRONG
CCFXB    OFF
